WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.095 --> 00:00:01.100
What's up everybody!

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.920
We are Pongfinity.

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:05.400
We know that you guys have been waiting for this a long time - and now it's happening.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.360
One game match between me and Otto.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.720
Let's go!

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:25.500
Don't give me there.

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:29.540
That's the biggest mistake you can make!

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:49.620
Almost!

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:54.520
Wow!

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:56.880
I didn't expect that one to come in.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:28.820
That was the second mistake you made.

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:30.080
One was the around the net-

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:31.160
That was the second.

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:04.360
You need to move!

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:05.420
Don't be like me!

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:18.720
Sorry!

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:20.340
That was down!

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:37.740
I saw you switching hand

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:39.740
So I was like "let's give him one".

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.720
Thanks!

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:12.640
I didn't really saw that last shot coming in from there but that was nice!

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.180
Nothing special for me.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:17.820
Let us know in the comments below what you want to see for the 800k special.

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:19.360
Remember to subscribe

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:21.280
And watch our previous episodes there.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:22.460
Until next time!

